 Like he starts moving the people, consecrating the people,

831
00:33:36,080 --> 00:33:38,520
 wooing the people,

832
00:33:38,520 --> 00:33:41,920
 instructing how they should interact with one another.

833
00:33:41,920 --> 00:33:47,640
 And yet right as Moses is coming down,

