 He's fun.

845
00:34:12,840 --> 00:34:15,400
 The two of you get along amazing.

846
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:16,320
 And so you decide, you know what?

847
00:34:16,320 --> 00:34:17,960
 Hey, like, let's meet the family.

848
00:34:17,960 --> 00:34:19,920
 Meet the families.

849
00:34:19,920 --> 00:34:21,080
 Oh, like, it's great.

850
00:34:21,080 --> 00:34:22,200
 I love the in-laws.

851
00:34:22,200 --> 00:34:24,360
 And you get engaged and you decide, okay,

852
00:34:24,360 --> 00:34:26,600
 it's time for us to get an apartment.

853
