00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:14,600
 who have an under reaction to his wrath against it.

907
00:37:14,600 --> 00:37:16,320
 That's why we take advantage of it.

908
00:37:16,320 --> 00:37:18,560
 That's why we have licensed by way of his grace.

