00:37:36,920 --> 00:37:38,800
 Psalm 145, three says, great is the Lord.

918
00:37:38,800 --> 00:37:39,680
 He's greatly to be praised.

919
00:37:39,680 --> 00:37:41,960
 His greatness is unsearchable.

